# Windows lit of an evening, the dusk as a time-lapse (reports/render-features/2026-11-15-night-interiors, step 1):
# the side view of the market house from 21:00 to 00:30, a shot every three game minutes (dusk-000 .. dusk-070).
# scripts/content/window_glow.py clip joins them. Content as for window-glow.bench.
# @timeout 420
cheat god
overlay off
view hide animated morph
cam lift off

set time 21 0
cam look -1270
goto pos 8436.212 2000 3968.510
cam world 1500 -1560 114.462
wait 34
cam hold
wait 6000
set time 21 0
wait 1100
shot dusk-000
wait 100
